{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792484675,"nonce":"mYwL6pDiYVXp8DrutHLkwEcyuwI=","title":"Show Markdown files in the project Explorer","message":"The Explorer's isSource predicate only accepts Haxe and RayScript in ordinary Haxe projects. Markdown is only accepted for extension/theme projects. The tree also only lists class-path roots, so project-level README.md and docs/ are absent even if the file-kind filter is widened.\n\nRecognize the production Markdown extension's suffixes case-insensitively, give them the Remix Markdown icon, and show project-level entries while keeping source folders expanded and all other folders lazily loaded. Preserve source roots outside the workspace. The production Markdown snapshot should open root and docs Markdown through actual Explorer rows rather than bypassing the tree through a command argument.","files":null}]}